    [ok ] rho = sqrt2-1 = 1/alpha  rho = 0.414213562373095
    [ok ] sum_k gamma_k = 2 exactly -- so Phi_h(Bern(1/2)) is REAL at this alpha  sum = 2.00000000000000000000

